<p>These terms and conditions apply to every order placed in this shop. Please read them carefully before you complete your order. By ticking the box at checkout you accept the version shown on this page.</p>
<h2 id="scope">1. Scope</h2>
<p>These terms apply to contracts between <strong>Fashion Web Store ApS</strong> (“we”, “us”) and you as a customer. Deviating terms of the customer are not accepted unless we agree to them in writing.</p>
<p>Consumers are natural persons who enter into a contract for purposes that are predominantly neither commercial nor self-employed.</p>
<h2 id="conclusion-of-contract">2. Conclusion of the contract</h2>
<p>The presentation of products in the shop is not a legally binding offer but an invitation to order. The contract is concluded in these steps:</p>
<ol>
<li>You put products in the cart and enter your address, shipping and payment method.</li>
<li>You review the order summary and click <em>Place order</em>. This is a binding offer to buy.</li>
<li>We confirm receipt by email. The contract is concluded when we send a second email confirming shipment, at the latest.</li>
</ol>
<h3>Language of the contract</h3>
<p>The contract is concluded in English. We store the contract text and send you the order details by email; this page always shows the version currently in force.</p>
<h2 id="prices-and-payment">3. Prices and payment</h2>
<p>All prices include VAT. Shipping costs are shown in the cart before you place your order.</p>
