<h2 id="delivery">4. Delivery</h2>
<p>We deliver to the countries shown at checkout. Unless stated otherwise in the product description, delivery takes 2–5 working days within the EU.</p>
<p><img src="https://placehold.co/1600x480/png?text=Delivery+zones" alt="Map of our delivery zones"></p>
<ul>
<li>Zone 1 (Denmark, Sweden, Norway): 1–2 working days</li>
<li>Zone 2 (rest of the EU): 2–5 working days</li>
<li>Zone 3 (rest of the world): 5–10 working days, plus customs clearance</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="right-of-withdrawal">5. Right of withdrawal</h2>
<p>As a consumer you can withdraw from the contract within 14 days without giving any reason. The full instructions and the model withdrawal form are on our <a href="/en_US/terms/right-of-withdrawal">Right of withdrawal</a> page.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>To exercise the right of withdrawal, you must inform us (Fashion Web Store ApS, Example Street 1, 9000 Aalborg, Denmark, <a href="mailto:returns@example.com">returns@example.com</a>) of your decision by an unequivocal statement.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="warranty">6. Warranty</h2>
<p>The statutory warranty rights apply. The warranty period for new goods is two years from delivery. Claims must be made within a reasonable time after you discover the defect.</p>
<h3>Our own guarantee</h3>
<p>Some products carry an additional manufacturer's guarantee. Its terms are given on the product page and do not limit your statutory rights.</p>
<h2 id="liability">7. Liability</h2>
<p>We are liable without limitation for intent and gross negligence. For slight negligence we are only liable for breaches of essential contractual obligations, limited to the damage that is typical and foreseeable for this type of contract.</p>
<h2 id="final-provisions">8. Final provisions</h2>
<p>Danish law applies, excluding the UN Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods. If you are a consumer, this choice of law does not deprive you of the protection of the mandatory provisions of the law of your country of residence. The European Commission provides a platform for online dispute resolution at <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr">https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr</a>.</p>
